{"key":"85:11:15","position":15,"arabic":"١١","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"85:12","translation":"Verily, (O Muhammad صلى الله عليه وسلم) the Seizure (punishment) of your Lord is severe and painful. [See V.11:102].","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"85:12:1","position":1,"arabic":"إِنَّ","kind":"word","gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","lemma":"إِنّ","root":null,"entryId":"l-3afba549abbd5639"},{"key":"85:12:2","position":2,"arabic":"بَطْشَ","kind":"word","gloss":"(the) Grip","transliteration":"baṭsha","lemma":"بَطْش","root":"بطش","entryId":null},{"key":"85:12:3","position":3,"arabic":"رَبِّكَ","kind":"word","gloss":"(of) your Lord","transliteration":"rabbika","lemma":"رَبّ","root":"ربب","entryId":"l-a0ed3c982709a296"},{"key":"85:12:4","position":4,"arabic":"لَشَدِيدٌ","kind":"word","gloss":"(is) surely strong","transliteration":"lashadīdun","lemma":"شَدِيد","root":"شدد","entryId":"l-85c14b6882876cfc"},{"key":"85:12:5","position":5,"arabic":"١٢","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"85:13","translation":"Verily, He it is Who begins (punishment) and repeats (punishment in the Hereafter) (or originates the creation of everything, and then repeats it on the Day of Resurrection).","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"85:13:1","position":1,"arabic":"إِنَّهُۥ","kind":"word","gloss":"Indeed He","transliteration":"innahu","lemma":"إِنّ","root":null,"entryId":"l-3afba549abbd5639"},{"key":"85:13:2","position":2,"arabic":"هُوَ","kind":"word","gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null},{"key":"85:13:3","position":3,"arabic":"يُبْدِئُ","kind":"word","gloss":"originates","transliteration":"yub'di-u","lemma":"يُبْدِئُ","root":"بدا","entryId":null},{"key":"85:13:4","position":4,"arabic":"وَيُعِيدُ","kind":"word","gloss":"and repeats","t